1
00:00:00,330 --> 00:00:02,238
若有一位亚马逊卖家
Imagine an Amazon seller

2
00:00:02,250 --> 00:00:04,818
一个月卖出了十万美元的商品
selling $100,000 of goods in a month.

3
00:00:04,830 --> 00:00:05,838
看到这个数字
Seeing that number

4
00:00:05,850 --> 00:00:06,858
你可能会觉得
you might think

5
00:00:06,870 --> 00:00:08,960
他的生意一定非常赚钱
the business must be highly profitable.

6
00:00:09,330 --> 00:00:12,380
但是销售额和利润其实是两回事
But sales and profit are different.

7
00:00:12,870 --> 00:00:15,920
销售额是顾客购买商品支付的钱
Revenue is what customers pay.

8
00:00:16,050 --> 00:00:18,018
而利润需要扣除
Profit requires subtracting

9
00:00:18,030 --> 00:00:20,600
经营过程中发生的各种成本
the costs of running the business.

10
00:00:20,910 --> 00:00:23,598
所以今天我们就用一组假设的数据
Today, we will use hypothetical figures

11
00:00:23,610 --> 00:00:26,360
看看这十万美元最后还剩下多少
to see how much of $100,000 remains.

12
00:00:27,030 --> 00:00:27,620
采购
Product sourcing.

13
00:00:27,870 --> 00:00:30,560
不同商品的采购成本差别很大
Purchase costs vary widely by product.

14
00:00:30,690 --> 00:00:33,258
但对于一些从工厂直接采购
For some goods sourced directly from factories

15
00:00:33,270 --> 00:00:36,080
售价和采购价差距比较大的商品
with a large gap between price and purchase cost

16
00:00:36,270 --> 00:00:39,680
采购成本可能只占销售额的一成到两成
purchase cost may be 10% to 20% of sales.

17
00:00:40,050 --> 00:00:42,078
我们今天假设这位卖家
In our illustrative scenario

18
00:00:42,090 --> 00:00:44,060
一个月销售额十万美元
monthly revenue is $100,000.

19
00:00:44,250 --> 00:00:46,940
商品采购成本是一万五千美元
Product purchases cost $15,000.

20
00:00:47,070 --> 00:00:49,340
也就是销售额的百分之十五
That is 15% of revenue.

21
00:00:49,590 --> 00:00:51,978
十万美元减去一万五千美元
Subtract $15,000 from $100,000.

22
00:00:51,990 --> 00:00:53,720
还剩八万五千美元
The remaining balance is $85,000.

23
00:00:53,790 --> 00:00:55,518
看起来很不错对不对
Looks good, right?

24
00:00:55,530 --> 00:00:57,138
但这八万五千美元
But that $85,000

25
00:00:57,150 --> 00:00:58,580
还远远不是利润
is still far from profit.

26
00:00:59,250 --> 00:01:01,338
接下来是我比较熟悉的部分
Next is an area I know well:

27
00:01:01,350 --> 00:01:02,240
国际物流
international logistics.

28
00:01:02,370 --> 00:01:05,358
假设这位卖家从海外工厂采购商品
Assume the seller sources goods overseas

29
00:01:05,370 --> 00:01:06,620
运到美国销售
to sell in the United States.

30
00:01:07,050 --> 00:01:09,860
商品生产完成以后需要安排运输
Once production ends, shipping begins.

31
00:01:10,170 --> 00:01:11,298
如果走海运
If the goods travel by sea

32
00:01:11,310 --> 00:01:15,560
货物要经过国内运输出口港口海上运输
the journey includes trucking, an export port and ocean freight

33
00:01:15,750 --> 00:01:17,060
再到美国港口
before reaching a US port.

34
00:01:17,370 --> 00:01:20,420
到港以后还要产生清关进口关税
Arrival also involves customs clearance and import duties

35
00:01:20,730 --> 00:01:21,738
码头费用
terminal charges

36
00:01:21,750 --> 00:01:24,920
以及送货到亚马逊仓库的运输费用
and transport to an Amazon warehouse.

37
00:01:24,990 --> 00:01:27,620
这些钱都要算进商品的成本
These costs belong in the cost calculation.

38
00:01:27,750 --> 00:01:31,220
我们假设这部分费用合计一万两千美元
Assume this stage totals $12,000.

39
00:01:31,470 --> 00:01:33,558
刚才剩下八万五千美元
We had $85,000 remaining.

40
00:01:33,570 --> 00:01:35,478
再减去一万两千美元
Subtract another $12,000.

41
00:01:35,490 --> 00:01:37,640
现在还剩七万三千美元
Now the balance is $73,000.

42
00:01:39,010 --> 00:01:41,880
接下来我们看看亚马逊的平台费用
Now let us examine Amazon platform fees.

43
00:01:42,070 --> 00:01:43,798
首先是Referral Fee
First is the referral fee.

44
00:01:43,810 --> 00:01:45,300
也就是销售佣金
This is the selling commission.

45
00:01:45,550 --> 00:01:48,180
根据亚马逊美国站的收费规则
Under Amazon US selling-fee rules

46
00:01:48,310 --> 00:01:51,600
不同类别的商品佣金比例是不一样的
referral rates differ by category.

47
00:01:51,790 --> 00:01:53,458
比如家居厨房用品
For example, Home & Kitchen

48
00:01:53,470 --> 00:01:56,280
通常适用百分之十五的销售佣金
typically uses a 15% referral rate.

49
00:01:56,410 --> 00:01:59,280
而电脑消费电子类等产品
Computers and consumer electronics

50
00:01:59,350 --> 00:02:01,860
适用的比例可能只有百分之八
may use an 8% rate.

51
00:02:02,110 --> 00:02:04,018
我们今天假设一个卖家
For our scenario, assume a seller

52
00:02:04,030 --> 00:02:08,100
销售的是适用百分之十五佣金的家居厨房商品
in Home & Kitchen with a 15% referral rate.

53
00:02:08,410 --> 00:02:10,378
那么十万美元的销售额
On $100,000 of revenue

54
00:02:10,390 --> 00:02:13,320
对应的销售佣金是一万五千美元
the referral fee is $15,000.

55
00:02:13,450 --> 00:02:14,520
这还没有完
That is not the end.

56
00:02:14,710 --> 00:02:16,438
如果卖家使用FBA
If the seller uses FBA

57
00:02:16,450 --> 00:02:19,740
也就是让亚马逊负责仓储和订单履约
Amazon handles storage and order fulfillment.

58
00:02:19,810 --> 00:02:22,920
还需要额外支付FBA Fulfillment Fee
There is also an FBA fulfillment fee.

59
00:02:22,990 --> 00:02:24,780
也就是订单履约费
That is the cost of fulfilling orders.

60
00:02:25,750 --> 00:02:27,658
这笔费用不是简单地按照
This fee is not simply calculated

61
00:02:27,670 --> 00:02:30,300
销售额的固定百分比计算的
as a fixed percentage of sales.

62
00:02:30,430 --> 00:02:33,058
它通常和商品的尺寸重量
It generally depends on dimensions, weight

63
00:02:33,070 --> 00:02:35,340
以及适用的收费标准有关
and the applicable fee schedule.

64
00:02:35,650 --> 00:02:38,220
比如同样卖一个二十美元的产品
Consider two products both priced at $20.

65
00:02:38,350 --> 00:02:40,078
一个小巧轻便的产品
One is small and light.

66
00:02:40,090 --> 00:02:41,878
和一个又大又重的商品
The other is large and heavy.

67
00:02:41,890 --> 00:02:44,220
FBA履约成本可能差很多
Their fulfillment costs can differ substantially.

68
00:02:44,590 --> 00:02:48,178
我们假设这位卖家当月的FBA履约成本
Assume this seller's monthly FBA fulfillment costs

69
00:02:48,190 --> 00:02:49,560
一万八千美元
total $18,000.

70
00:02:49,690 --> 00:02:51,840
那么销售佣金一万五千
The $15,000 referral fee

71
00:02:52,030 --> 00:02:54,658
加上FBA履约费一万八千
plus $18,000 in fulfillment fees

72
00:02:54,670 --> 00:02:56,760
总共是三万三千美元
comes to $33,000.

73
00:02:57,010 --> 00:02:59,038
刚才剩下七万三千美元
We had $73,000 remaining.

74
00:02:59,050 --> 00:03:00,958
再减去三万三千美元
Subtract $33,000.

75
00:03:00,970 --> 00:03:03,000
现在只剩下四万美元
The balance is now $40,000.

76
00:03:04,490 --> 00:03:07,120
除了销售佣金和订单履约费
Besides referral and fulfillment fees

77
00:03:07,310 --> 00:03:10,600
亚马逊卖家还需要关注一个仓储成本
Amazon sellers must also watch storage costs.

78
00:03:10,790 --> 00:03:12,458
这里特别需要注意
An important distinction:

79
00:03:12,470 --> 00:03:15,458
FBA Fulfillment Fee和Storage Fee
FBA fulfillment fees and storage fees

80
00:03:15,470 --> 00:03:16,960
是两笔不同的费用
are different charges.

81
00:03:17,150 --> 00:03:19,538
订单履约费主要与处理订单
Fulfillment fees relate mainly to order processing

82
00:03:19,550 --> 00:03:21,760
分拣包装和配送有关
picking, packing and delivery.

83
00:03:21,890 --> 00:03:25,480
而仓储费则和商品占用了多少仓储空间
Storage fees depend on the space goods occupy

84
00:03:25,610 --> 00:03:28,120
存放了多少时间等因素有关
and how long they stay, among other factors.

85
00:03:28,370 --> 00:03:30,940
如果商品体积大库存周转慢
Bulky goods or slow-moving inventory

86
00:03:31,010 --> 00:03:34,058
或者产生了额外的库存相关费用
may also incur additional inventory-related charges.

87
00:03:34,070 --> 00:03:35,860
成本可能进一步增加
Costs can rise further.

88
00:03:36,050 --> 00:03:39,640
我们假设这位卖家有一部分库存周转比较慢
Assume some of this seller's inventory moves slowly.

89
00:03:40,070 --> 00:03:43,900
当月仓储以及相关库存费用合计六千美元
Monthly storage and related inventory costs total $6,000.

90
00:03:44,210 --> 00:03:45,878
刚才剩下四万美元
We had $40,000 remaining.

91
00:03:45,890 --> 00:03:47,500
再减去六千美元
Subtract $6,000.

92
00:03:47,630 --> 00:03:50,020
现在只剩下三万四千美元
Now the balance is $34,000.

93
00:03:50,210 --> 00:03:53,260
所以库存不只是放在仓库里的商品
Inventory is more than goods sitting in a warehouse.

94
00:03:53,390 --> 00:03:56,200
它还可能意味着持续增加的成本
It can mean ongoing costs

95
00:03:56,270 --> 00:03:57,940
以及被占用的现金
and cash tied up in stock.

96
00:03:58,633 --> 00:04:03,583
本段录音尚未提供
Scene 06 narration has not been supplied.

97
00:04:03,633 --> 00:04:08,583
广告投入：两万美元
Advertising spend in the model: $20,000.

98
00:04:08,633 --> 00:04:13,583
总销售额：十万美元
Total revenue in the model: $100,000.

99
00:04:13,633 --> 00:04:18,583
TACOS = 广告花费 ÷ 总销售额
TACOS = ad spend divided by total revenue.

100
00:04:18,633 --> 00:04:23,583
本例TACOS为20%，ACOS无法计算
TACOS is 20%; ACOS is unavailable.

101
00:04:23,633 --> 00:04:28,583
缺少广告归因销售额，不虚构数据
Ad-attributed sales have not been provided.

102
00:04:29,683 --> 00:04:31,953
最后我们还要考虑退货
Finally, consider returns

103
00:04:32,023 --> 00:04:34,353
商品损耗以及其他费用
product losses and other costs.

104
00:04:34,663 --> 00:04:36,451
比如消费者退货以后
For example, after a customer return

105
00:04:36,463 --> 00:04:38,553
商品可能无法重新销售
an item may be impossible to resell.

106
00:04:38,803 --> 00:04:41,973
有些退货还可能涉及额外的处理费用
Some returns also create handling costs.

107
00:04:42,043 --> 00:04:45,331
我们假设这些没有在前面重复计算的费用
Assume these costs, not already counted above,

108
00:04:45,343 --> 00:04:46,713
合计七千美元
total $7,000.

109
00:04:46,903 --> 00:04:49,051
刚才剩下的一万四千美元
We had $14,000 remaining.

110
00:04:49,063 --> 00:04:50,611
再减去七千美元
Subtract $7,000.

111
00:04:50,623 --> 00:04:52,593
最后只剩下七千美元
Only $7,000 remains.

112
00:04:52,723 --> 00:04:55,533
现在我们再把整笔账重新看一遍
Now let us review the full calculation.

113
00:04:55,783 --> 00:04:57,513
月销售十万美元
Monthly revenue: $100,000.

114
00:04:57,643 --> 00:04:59,433
商品采购成本一万五
Product cost: $15,000.

115
00:04:59,683 --> 00:05:03,153
国际物流关税和入仓一万两千美元
International logistics, duties and inbound: $12,000.

116
00:05:03,643 --> 00:05:07,113
亚马逊销售佣金一万五千美元
Referral fees: $15,000.

117
00:05:07,303 --> 00:05:10,293
FBA订单履约费一万八千美元
FBA fulfillment: $18,000.

118
00:05:10,423 --> 00:05:13,951
仓储以及相关库存成本六千美元
Storage and related inventory costs: $6,000.

119
00:05:13,963 --> 00:05:15,693
广告费口播金额待核对
Advertising: spoken amount requires review.

120
00:05:15,823 --> 00:05:19,293
退货损耗以及其他列示费用七千美元
Returns and other listed costs: $7,000.

121
00:05:19,423 --> 00:05:22,353
全部加起来成本是九万三千美元
Total listed costs: $93,000.

122
00:05:22,543 --> 00:05:24,931
十万美元减去九万三千美元
Subtract $93,000 from $100,000.

123
00:05:24,943 --> 00:05:26,373
只剩七千美元
Only $7,000 remains.

124
00:05:26,683 --> 00:05:28,833
也就是销售额的百分之七
That is 7% of revenue.

125
00:05:29,143 --> 00:05:32,313
而且这七千美元还不一定是最终净利润
This $7,000 is not necessarily final net profit.

126
00:05:32,683 --> 00:05:37,233
因为可能还没有计算进去一些经营费用和税费
Other operating expenses and taxes may be missing.

127
00:05:37,783 --> 00:05:40,171
这是一组假设的数据
These figures are hypothetical.

128
00:05:40,183 --> 00:05:43,233
不代表亚马逊卖家的实际成本结构
They do not represent sellers' actual cost structures.

129
00:05:43,363 --> 00:05:45,091
但它说明了一个问题
They illustrate one point:

130
00:05:45,103 --> 00:05:48,693
采购成本低不代表最后利润一定高
Low purchase costs do not guarantee high profit.

131
00:05:53,323 --> 00:05:57,031
那么亚马逊卖家应该重点关注哪些数据呢
Which metrics should an Amazon seller watch?

132
00:05:57,043 --> 00:05:58,713
我认为至少有三个
I would highlight at least three.

133
00:05:58,963 --> 00:06:01,533
第一个是单件商品的贡献利润
First, contribution margin per unit.

134
00:06:01,723 --> 00:06:04,233
不是只看售价减去采购价
It is more than price minus purchase cost.

135
00:06:04,303 --> 00:06:06,631
而是要考虑每卖出一件商品
Consider all the relevant variable costs

136
00:06:06,643 --> 00:06:08,853
所产生的相关变动成本
that arise from selling each unit.

137
00:06:09,223 --> 00:06:10,831
第二个是广告效率
Second, advertising efficiency.

138
00:06:10,843 --> 00:06:13,113
这里有两个容易混淆的指标
Two metrics are easily confused.

139
00:06:13,183 --> 00:06:17,973
ACOS是广告花费除以广告带来的销售额
ACOS is ad spend divided by ad-attributed sales.

140
00:06:18,523 --> 00:06:23,013
TACOS是广告花费除以店铺总销售额
TACOS is ad spend divided by total store revenue.

141
00:06:23,443 --> 00:06:24,811
比如我们这个案例
In our scenario

142
00:06:24,823 --> 00:06:26,551
广告花费两万美元
ad spend is $20,000.

143
00:06:26,563 --> 00:06:28,353
总销售额十万美元
Total revenue is $100,000.

144
00:06:28,543 --> 00:06:31,533
那么TACOS就是百分之二十
So TACOS is 20%.

145
00:06:32,083 --> 00:06:35,431
但如果不知道广告直接带来了多少销售额
Without the sales attributed to ads

146
00:06:35,443 --> 00:06:37,503
就不能计算ACOS
we cannot calculate ACOS.

147
00:06:38,023 --> 00:06:41,013
第三个库存周转和现金流
Third, inventory turnover and cash flow.

148
00:06:41,383 --> 00:06:43,831
商品卖不出去不仅占用资金
Unsold goods tie up cash

149
00:06:43,843 --> 00:06:46,293
还可能持续产生仓储费用
and can keep generating storage costs.

150
00:06:46,483 --> 00:06:48,513
所以真正值得关注的
What really matters

151
00:06:48,943 --> 00:06:51,213
不只是销售额增长了多少
is not just sales growth

152
00:06:51,643 --> 00:06:53,551
而是扣掉各项成本以后
but how much remains

153
00:06:53,563 --> 00:06:55,833
生意到底还能剩下多少钱
after all the relevant costs.
